# Elgato Wave XLR (0fd9:007d) intermittently drops off USB and re-enumerates.
# PipeWire leaves the capture PCM wedged when that happens, so bounce the card
# profile via a user service once the sound card node re-appears.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="sound", KERNEL=="card*", \
  ATTRS{idVendor}=="0fd9", ATTRS{idProduct}=="007d", \
  TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_USER_WANTS}+="wave-xlr-recover.service"
